{"lyrics":"[00:00.52]Uh, she'll kill me if she heard it (Kill me if she heard it, KID-KID-KID)\n[00:04.82]She'll kill me if she heard it (She kill me if she heard it, KID)\n[00:08.22]Ayy, that bitch would kill me, haha, ayy (I am, KID)\n[00:11.12]Ayy, ayy, ayy (3-2-1 Drop It, no-no)\n[00:11.86]She'll kill me if she (If she heard I was poppin' ecstasy, KID-KID)\n[00:19.20]Ayy, swoo, yeah, swoo (Yeah)\n[00:22.68]She'll kill me if she heard I was poppin' ecstasy (Yeah), or amphetamine medicine, but I been stressin' out (Go)\n[00:29.52]I'ma blame it on the government, yeah, it's the men again, they treat us niggas just like mannequins, we just get tossed around (KID-KID)\n[00:36.18]Even when a nigga president (I am), they still gon' fuck around (I am)\n[00:39.38]Bein' sober is an understatement, but it's overrated (Let's go, 3-2-1 Drop It)\n[00:42.58]I'm smokin' 'til my eyes are bleedin' and my head is blazin' (KID-KID-KID)\n[00:46.28]I'm poppin' 'til my hands are shakin' and my heart is racin', yeah (Yeah, KID)\n[00:50.20]I-I-I need molly, molly, molly, let's get wasted, yeah (Let's get wasted, yeah)\n[00:55.68]I- I felt the temperature drop, I hear what you sayin' and I understand (I am)\n[00:58.50]I get it, I get it, I know I should stop (Oh no, yeah)\n[01:00.38]I need a way to get back to the top (Yeah), I need a way to get outta this slump (Yeah)\n[01:03.72]I need a way to get way out and stay out and build up a layout to fuck up the world (DJ Anuedy)\n[01:06.94]I go political for the publicity, I'ma get ignorant just for the industry (Woah, woah, woah)\n[01:10.54]I get chaotic to match all the chaos and I'ma get radical just for my enemies (Woah, woah, woah)\n[01:13.98]Fuck it, I'm fucked up, I know it, I know it (Woah, woah, woah)\n[01:15.26]Lookin' like what in the fuck's gotten into me (Woah, I am)\n[01:17.12]I said the Hennesy mixed with the Rémy's the remedy (Woah, qoah)\n[01:18.98]Look at your boy doin' chemistry (Woah, 3-2-1 Drop It)\n[01:20.54]Hahaha (Fully know what you can do in this life)\n[01:26.20]This shit is so fuckin' sick, haha (You are amazing, KID-KID-KID)\n[01:29.60]Change the world type shit (I can see the world with my eyes, don't believe)\n[01:32.96]Screamin', \"Fuck everything\" you feel me? Haha (Keep working on that music)\n[01:40.36](Keep turning up on these ho mothafuckers')\n[01:44.48]You gotta live your life, like, like it's yours, you feel me? (So you can fully understand)\n[01:47.42]Don't give a fuck about nothin', bro, just do you (Woo-woo)\n[01:51.18]I'ma turn up 'til I can't do it no more (I am)\n[01:54.62]I'ma fuck her 'til I can't do it no more (I am)\n[01:56.48]This is real life, this is not a promo (No-no)\n[01:58.74]I'ma fuck the world up, nigga, let's go (Yeah, Drop It)\n[02:04.42]Nigga, let's go (Yeah), nigga, let's go (Yeah)\n[02:14.82]We gon' fuck the world up, nigga, let's go (Yeah)\n[02:16.10]Nigga, let's go (Go), nigga, let's go (Go)\n[02:17.04]We gon' fuck the world, nigga, let's go (3-2-1)\n[02:18.14]Perfect, I'ma pop a Percocet (I am, KID-KID-KID)\n[02:19.62]I'ma pour me up some purple shit to find some perfectness (I will)\n[02:22.90]I mean all these niggas clowns, take 'em to the circuses (Yeah)\n[02:26.18]And I swear this case is closed like the fuckin' curtains is (Yeah, 3-2-1 Drop It)\n[02:29.62]That means that I would play, but you be on your actin' shit (You do)\n[02:32.86]I got brothas movin' packages and poppin' Xe mints (Yeah, KID-KID-KId)\n[02:36.08]Want that work, they give it to you, ain't no fuckin' estimate (KID)\n[02:39.54]I been shittin', shittin', shittin' on 'em, hear my excrement, yeah (3-2-1 Drop It)\n[02:44.52]I'ma turn up 'til I can't do it no more (I am)\n[02:47.84]I'ma fuck her 'til I can't do it no more (I am)\n[02:51.08]This is real life, this is not a promo (No-no)\n[03:00.52]I'ma fuck the world up, nigga, let's go (Yeah)\n[03:04.40]Nigga, let's go (Yeah), nigga, let's go (Yeah)\n[03:08.14]We gon' fuck the world up, nigga, let's go (Yeah)\n[03:10.84]Nigga, let's go (Go), nigga, let's go (Go)\n[03:17.14]We gon' fuck the world, nigga, let's go (3-2-1 Drop It)\n[03:23.44]I am, I am (KID-KID-KID, KID)\n[03:27.52]No-no (Nice to meet-)\n[03:29.78]I am, I am (KID-KID-KID, KID)\n[03:34.34]No-no, we gon' fuck the world, nigga, let's go (3-2-1 Drop It)","words":[[0.52,0.56,"Uh,"],[0.64,0.86,"she'll"],[1.06,1.46,"kill"],[1.68,1.72,"me"],[1.94,2.08,"if"],[2.66,2.74,"she"],[2.84,2.98,"heard"],[3.04,3.1,"it"],[3.16,3.3,"(Kill"],[3.36,3.44,"me"],[3.62,3.66,"if"],[3.74,3.78,"she"],[3.96,4.14,"heard"],[4.22,4.34,"it,"],[4.4,4.78,"KID-KID-KID)"],[4.82,4.98,"She'll"],[5.06,5.14,"kill"],[5.18,5.2,"me"],[5.24,5.26,"if"],[5.34,5.42,"she"],[6.04,6.24,"heard"],[6.28,6.42,"it"],[6.46,6.54,"(She"],[6.66,6.84,"kill"],[7.06,7.14,"me"],[7.22,7.34,"if"],[7.68,7.76,"she"],[7.88,7.98,"heard"],[8.04,8.06,"it,"],[8.1,8.14,"KID)"],[8.22,8.4,"Ayy,"],[8.94,9.12,"that"],[9.22,9.38,"bitch"],[9.62,9.76,"would"],[9.8,9.94,"kill"],[10.02,10.04,"me,"],[10.2,10.28,"haha,"],[10.42,10.58,"ayy"],[10.62,10.62,"(I"],[10.78,10.86,"am,"],[10.94,11.02,"KID)"],[11.12,11.18,"Ayy,"],[11.22,11.3,"ayy,"],[11.34,11.4,"ayy"],[11.42,11.44,"(3-2-1"],[11.48,11.58,"Drop"],[11.62,11.64,"It,"],[11.7,11.82,"no-no)"],[11.86,12.1,"She'll"],[13.2,13.28,"kill"],[13.32,13.34,"me"],[13.42,13.44,"if"],[13.52,13.62,"she"],[13.82,13.94,"(If"],[14.12,14.18,"she"],[17.32,17.52,"heard"],[17.6,17.6,"I"],[17.76,17.82,"was"],[17.92,18.36,"poppin'"],[18.4,18.52,"ecstasy,"],[18.7,19.16,"KID-KID)"],[19.2,19.28,"Ayy,"],[19.36,19.56,"swoo,"],[19.66,19.82,"yeah,"],[20.14,20.24,"swoo"],[20.36,21.86,"(Yeah)"],[22.68,22.98,"She'll"],[23.08,23.24,"kill"],[23.32,23.4,"me"],[23.58,23.64,"if"],[23.72,23.8,"she"],[23.92,24.36,"heard"],[24.4,24.4,"I"],[24.44,24.66,"was"],[24.76,25.12,"poppin'"],[25.24,25.6,"ecstasy"],[25.64,26.04,"(Yeah),"],[26.1,26.48,"or"],[26.74,27.34,"amphetamine"],[27.38,27.88,"medicine,"],[27.92,28.12,"but"],[28.18,28.18,"I"],[28.3,28.4,"been"],[28.46,29.0,"stressin'"],[29.04,29.1